  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.ask": "Ask",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.ask.hint": "Open a conversation: who they are, their sect and its people, the sects nearby.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.gift": "Gift",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.gift.hint": "Give what you hold. Old herbs, fine pills and Cultivation Fruit please the weak most; the strong are harder to impress.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.greet": "Greet",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.greet.hint": "Bow, or cup your fist, as befits the two of you. Good manners are remembered, once a day.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.provoke": "Provoke",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.intent.provoke.hint": "Insult them. They will think less of you, and they may decide to teach you a lesson.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.commoner": "Me, Immortal? I know very little, but ask.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.commoner.mortal": "Ask away, friend.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.demonic.above": "Questions cost nothing. Answers might.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.demonic.below": "Senior wishes to know? Ask, ask.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.demonic.far_above": "You want something from me? How bold. Ask, before I lose interest.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.demonic.far_below": "This one will hold nothing back from Senior!",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.demonic.mortal": "A curious mortal. Ask; it amuses me.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.demonic.peer": "Ask. I'll decide what's true.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.neutral.above": "Ask.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.neutral.below": "Ask, Senior.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.neutral.far_above": "Be brief.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.neutral.far_below": "Senior need only ask.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.neutral.mortal": "What does a mortal want to know?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.neutral.peer": "What would you know?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.righteous.above": "Questions? Ask, then. I have a little time.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.righteous.below": "Senior may ask anything.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.righteous.far_above": "Speak quickly, junior. This one has little time.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.righteous.far_below": "Whatever Senior wishes to know, this one will answer.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.righteous.mortal": "Ask, then. Briefly.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.ask.righteous.peer": "Ask, fellow Daoist. I'll answer what I can.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.good.commoner": "This is too much, Immortal. Thank you!",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.good.demonic": "Now this is a proper gift.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.good.neutral": "Useful. My thanks.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.good.righteous": "This is generous. I won't forget it.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.great.commoner": "I... I don't know what to say. Thank you, Immortal!",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.great.demonic": "Ha! You do understand how the world works.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.great.neutral": "This is worth a great deal. I'll remember it.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.great.righteous": "Such a treasure... this one is in your debt.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.refuse.commoner": "I couldn't take that, Immortal.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.refuse.demonic": "Are you mocking me?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.refuse.neutral": "What would I do with that?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.refuse.righteous": "This one cannot accept that.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.small.commoner": "For me? Thank you, Immortal.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.small.demonic": "Is that all?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.small.neutral": "Hm. Thank you.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.gift.small.righteous": "A kind thought. Thank you.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.commoner": "Greetings, Immortal. Safe travels.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.commoner.mortal": "Good day to you, traveller.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.demonic.above": "Little one, you have manners. They might even keep you alive.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.demonic.below": "Senior... this one meant no offence. None at all.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.demonic.far_above": "An ant that bows. How sweet. Crawl along.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.demonic.far_below": "S-senior! This worthless one greets Senior!",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.demonic.mortal": "A mortal, walking right up to me. Brave, or stupid?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.demonic.peer": "Fellow Daoist. Shall we pretend we're friends?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.neutral.above": "Junior. What is it?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.neutral.below": "Senior. This one is listening.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.neutral.far_above": "Hm.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.neutral.far_below": "Senior's presence is... considerable. How can this one help?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.neutral.mortal": "A mortal. Keep out from underfoot and no one will trouble you.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.neutral.peer": "Fellow Daoist.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.righteous.above": "Well met, little friend. Your foundation looks steady.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.righteous.below": "Senior honours this one by stopping. Please, be at ease.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.righteous.far_above": "Junior. Keep to the path and mind your manners on this mountain.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.righteous.far_below": "This junior greets Senior! What does Senior require?",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.righteous.mortal": "A mortal this far up? Go carefully, and keep to the path.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.greet.righteous.peer": "Fellow Daoist. May your path be clear and your heart steady.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.nearby": "The %1$s, on the %2$s path, lies %3$s of here, %4$s blocks or so.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.nearby.enemy": "The %1$s, %2$s-path dogs, are %3$s of here, %4$s blocks or so. Keep clear of them.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.nearby.none": "No sect that I know of, not within a few days on foot.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.people": "Guarding the treasury and the core: %1$s. Sect Master %2$s keeps the main hall.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.people.alone": "There is no one else to answer for this sect.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.people.master_self": "Guarding the treasury and the core: %1$s. The main hall is mine.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.people.no_elders": "Sect Master %1$s keeps the main hall. We have no elders now.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.people.no_master": "Guarding the treasury and the core: %1$s. We have no master now.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.attack.commoner": "That's enough! I won't be spoken to like that!",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.attack.demonic": "I was hoping you'd say that.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.attack.neutral": "You'll regret that.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.attack.righteous": "Then let your blade speak for you!",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.scorn.commoner": "Please, Immortal, I don't want any trouble.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.scorn.demonic": "Barking at me? Cute.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.scorn.neutral": "I've no time for fools.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.provoke.scorn.righteous": "Your words dirty only yourself.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.sect": "The %1$s: %2$s of us, on the %3$s path, led by Sect Master %4$s at %5$s.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.sect.no_master": "The %1$s: %2$s of us, on the %3$s path.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.sect.self_master": "The %1$s: %2$s of us, on the %3$s path. I lead it.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.commoner": "%1$s. I'm only a mortal, Immortal. I have no cultivation to speak of.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.rogue.demonic": "%1$s, at %2$s. I answer to no sect, and to no one.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.rogue.neutral": "%1$s. %2$s. I go where the qi is.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.rogue.righteous": "I am %1$s, a wandering cultivator at %2$s. No sect, only the road.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.sect.demonic": "%1$s, %2$s of the %3$s, at %4$s. Remember the name. It may be the last one you learn.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.sect.neutral": "%1$s, %2$s of the %3$s. %4$s. That's all there is to say.",
  "cultivation.defying-the-heavens.talk.line.self.sect.righteous": "I am %1$s, %2$s of the %3$s, at %4$s. I walk the righteous path.",
